WEBVTT

01:40.060 --> 01:42.979
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.170 --> 01:46.000
[Episode 17]

01:48.430 --> 01:49.360
Dream.

02:03.070 --> 02:03.870
Zhuo.

02:07.390 --> 02:08.190
Mr. Zhuo!

02:31.800 --> 02:32.630
Sister Pei!

02:32.630 --> 02:33.770
Sister Pei.

02:49.050 --> 02:50.850
But you have the One-Word Spell.

02:50.870 --> 02:52.630
You can control me at any time.

02:52.820 --> 02:53.940
I know.

02:54.920 --> 02:56.550
That's why I'll give you the ability

02:56.550 --> 02:58.560
to be immune to my One-Word Spell.

03:00.070 --> 03:00.930
Dream.

04:08.580 --> 04:09.770
Ying Zhao.

04:11.440 --> 04:12.730
Do it now.

04:15.390 --> 04:16.769
Kill me!

04:41.650 --> 04:42.990
I killed her.

04:44.210 --> 04:45.920
I killed so many people.

04:48.330 --> 04:50.050
I don't deserve to live.

04:54.560 --> 04:56.030
The blood moon

04:56.540 --> 04:58.400
is filled with malicious energy.

04:58.860 --> 05:00.060
What killed them

05:00.870 --> 05:02.630
was the persistent malicious energy

05:02.630 --> 05:04.900
in this world.

05:05.310 --> 05:06.380
You

05:06.630 --> 05:08.220
are merely a vessel

05:08.270 --> 05:11.190
carrying the world's anger and murderous intent.

05:12.870 --> 05:15.020
If this world gave me life

05:15.430 --> 05:17.630
to be manipulated by malicious energy,

05:18.630 --> 05:20.450
then I'd rather die.

05:20.590 --> 05:21.880
If you died,

05:22.270 --> 05:24.600
there would naturally be another vessel.

05:32.030 --> 05:33.659
This liquid

05:33.990 --> 05:36.650
is made from Jade Ointment and Heartless Grass.

05:40.390 --> 05:42.720
It can suppress malicious energy.

05:45.570 --> 05:46.600
If…

05:48.980 --> 05:50.510
If one day

05:51.590 --> 05:53.630
I lose control again…

05:55.800 --> 05:57.680
you must kill me.

06:03.030 --> 06:04.120
Quick!

06:05.730 --> 06:06.980
Kill me!

06:13.480 --> 06:14.660
Boy.

06:17.270 --> 06:19.050
I have to go.

06:20.670 --> 06:21.490
Grandpa,

06:22.110 --> 06:23.470
what are you going to do?

06:27.770 --> 06:29.150
Mr. Ying Zhao.

06:29.470 --> 06:30.750
Dharma.

06:33.480 --> 06:35.250
Return.

06:41.300 --> 06:42.500
Grandpa!

06:42.520 --> 06:43.380
Grandpa!

06:43.400 --> 06:44.340
Grandpa!

07:01.640 --> 07:07.660
♫Someday I'll return to my old hometown♫

07:08.490 --> 07:14.560
♫Wearing old clothes but with eyes shining bright♫

07:10.270 --> 07:11.070
Grandpa.

07:12.230 --> 07:13.040
Grandpa!

07:15.510 --> 07:17.500
♫Holding brilliance in the right hand♫

07:17.530 --> 07:19.460
♫Biting down on all panic♫

07:19.480 --> 07:20.960
♫Wiping away frost with the left hand♫

07:21.000 --> 07:22.800
♫I finally look up♫

07:22.840 --> 07:25.690
♫You're in front of me♫

07:26.570 --> 07:28.740
♫Blocking the pain♫

07:29.460 --> 07:32.780
♫Who cries with swollen eyes?♫

07:33.400 --> 07:36.240
♫With a broken heart♫

07:36.270 --> 07:37.630
Mr. Ying Zhao!

07:36.480 --> 07:39.280
♫Walking, stopping♫

07:39.330 --> 07:42.240
♫Chasing your voice♫

07:42.500 --> 07:43.300
Grandpa.

07:42.780 --> 07:46.430
♫I'll turn into raindrops♫

07:43.870 --> 07:44.920
Grandpa.

07:45.870 --> 07:47.220
Grandpa, don't go!

07:46.710 --> 07:49.380
♫An ancient song♫

07:47.220 --> 07:47.870
Grandpa.

07:48.340 --> 07:49.230
Grandpa.

07:49.470 --> 07:49.990
Ying Lei.

07:49.690 --> 07:52.520
♫Running towards you♫

07:50.930 --> 07:52.740
I won't go play in the mortal world again.

07:52.740 --> 07:54.260
I won't go to the mortal world ever again.

07:53.010 --> 07:55.909
♫Looking for you♫

07:54.310 --> 07:54.990
Okay?

07:54.990 --> 07:56.240
Grandpa, Grandpa.

07:56.480 --> 08:00.290
♫I finally heard the wind say♫

08:00.330 --> 08:03.400
♫Knowing where you are♫

08:03.520 --> 08:06.220
♫It'll lead me♫

08:06.900 --> 08:09.700
♫To find you♫

08:10.260 --> 08:12.250
♫Find you♫

08:16.970 --> 08:19.680
♫Find you♫

09:41.930 --> 09:45.830
♫In this bustling world♫

09:47.880 --> 09:52.110
♫Scattered traces remain♫

09:53.650 --> 10:01.410
♫The riddle of time♫

10:05.770 --> 10:10.500
♫The joy and sorrow of life♫

10:11.910 --> 10:16.010
♫A few hasty lines♫

10:18.030 --> 10:25.650
♫Addressing love and hate♫

10:27.390 --> 10:28.190
If…

10:29.550 --> 10:31.070
If one day

10:29.750 --> 10:37.430
♫Addressing love and hate♫

10:31.180 --> 10:33.410
I lose control again,

10:33.600 --> 10:35.660
you must kill me.

10:36.310 --> 10:38.870
I'm not able to do that.

10:41.860 --> 10:42.890
But

10:43.810 --> 10:45.330
I'll think of a way.

11:26.590 --> 11:27.750
Do you hate him?

11:30.420 --> 11:31.450
I know

11:31.480 --> 11:33.680
he was controlled by malicious energy.

11:34.740 --> 11:36.220
He didn't mean it.

11:38.430 --> 11:39.460
But he

11:41.220 --> 11:43.070
indeed killed my master.

11:47.010 --> 11:49.270
I killed my brother with my own hands too.

11:52.950 --> 11:55.070
Heng was controlled by Cheng Huang.

11:55.300 --> 11:57.430
There was nothing he could do about it.

11:57.860 --> 11:59.190
I worked in the Chongwu Camp

11:59.190 --> 12:00.470
and had to kill him.

12:01.140 --> 12:02.860
I had no choice either.

12:04.130 --> 12:05.720
After knowing the truth,

12:05.870 --> 12:08.070
I've been searching for a solution.

12:08.110 --> 12:10.490
I don't want the tragedy that befell my brother and me

12:10.490 --> 12:12.320
to happen to anyone else.

12:15.250 --> 12:16.950
But I've long forgiven you.

12:30.110 --> 12:31.630
Zhao Yuanzhou saved the last trace of my soul

12:31.630 --> 12:33.650
before it completely vanished

12:33.680 --> 12:35.310
and attached it to a puppet.

12:36.350 --> 12:38.190
It's no simple magic.

12:39.190 --> 12:42.720
It must have cost him at least a thousand years of magical power.

12:43.750 --> 12:45.940
Do you have any unfulfilled wishes?

12:46.870 --> 12:48.260
I wish I could

12:48.500 --> 12:49.960
always protect my sister.

13:10.640 --> 13:11.870
Wen Xiao,

13:12.630 --> 13:14.290
cry if you want to.

13:20.510 --> 13:22.490
When I was a puppet…

13:24.190 --> 13:25.360
I couldn't cry

13:26.410 --> 13:28.210
because wood didn't have tears.

14:33.450 --> 14:34.310
Zhu Yan!

14:34.750 --> 14:36.070
You brat!

14:36.230 --> 14:37.830
You haven't learned to control malicious energy yet,

14:37.830 --> 14:39.760
but you left the mountain secretly.

14:39.760 --> 14:42.080
You're so bold!

14:45.670 --> 14:46.750
I've already learned it.

14:46.750 --> 14:48.080
The hell you have!

14:49.870 --> 14:50.710
You…

14:52.230 --> 14:53.490
You bought them for me?

14:54.730 --> 14:56.190
I picked them up on the way.

16:02.910 --> 16:04.710
But you have the One-Word Spell.

16:04.910 --> 16:06.570
You can control me at any time.

16:07.510 --> 16:08.420
I know.

16:08.990 --> 16:10.490
So I'll give you the ability

16:10.490 --> 16:12.350
to be immune to my One-Word Spell.

16:14.710 --> 16:15.910
How long will it last?

16:20.480 --> 16:21.280
Forever.

16:24.530 --> 16:26.060
I'm dead set on killing you,

16:27.030 --> 16:29.330
yet you're giving your weapon to me.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.490
I don't understand.

16:34.470 --> 16:36.130
He didn't give you a weapon.

16:36.930 --> 16:38.490
Instead, he gave you armor

16:39.170 --> 16:40.890
to fight against him.

16:56.350 --> 16:57.440
Mountain God.

17:01.270 --> 17:02.550
Do you hate him?

17:05.310 --> 17:05.910
Of course.

17:11.020 --> 17:12.210
Zhao Yuanzhou

17:12.250 --> 17:13.310
once

17:13.310 --> 17:15.190
gave me a bag of roasted walnuts.

17:15.940 --> 17:17.109
When I went down the mountain one day,

17:17.109 --> 17:18.650
I saw a stall selling them

17:19.230 --> 17:20.280
and tried one,

17:20.670 --> 17:22.460
but it nearly broke my teeth.

17:23.750 --> 17:24.839
Only then

17:24.869 --> 17:26.109
did I realize that

17:27.030 --> 17:30.160
not every walnut's shell was as thin and crispy as paper.

17:31.790 --> 17:32.630
In the past,

17:32.630 --> 17:34.490
every single walnut he bought for me

17:34.490 --> 17:37.060
had been carefully selected by him.

17:39.610 --> 17:40.660
Tell me,

17:40.790 --> 17:42.190
could someone

17:42.280 --> 17:44.200
so attentive and kind-hearted

17:44.680 --> 17:46.590
be an extremely evil demon?

17:54.830 --> 17:55.710
As for me,

17:55.740 --> 17:57.420
I'm indeed old now.

17:58.230 --> 18:00.300
My divine power is nearly depleted.

18:02.040 --> 18:03.030
I hope

18:03.110 --> 18:05.010
that the last bit of my power

18:05.030 --> 18:06.710
can be of help to you guys.

18:07.630 --> 18:10.030
I've mastered the Bingyi Sword Technique.

18:11.070 --> 18:12.600
I'll kill him myself.

18:15.240 --> 18:16.760
Mr. Zhuo.

18:17.450 --> 18:19.230
I'm older than you,

18:19.770 --> 18:21.520
so allow me to call you Zhuo.

18:23.020 --> 18:23.860
I know

18:23.890 --> 18:25.490
your hatred is hard to quell.

18:26.940 --> 18:28.010
But Zhao Yuanzhou

18:28.800 --> 18:30.800
is a pitiful person who doesn't have

18:30.880 --> 18:32.090
many options.

18:32.760 --> 18:33.970
All these years,

18:33.990 --> 18:35.510
he's been in a lot of pain

18:35.800 --> 18:37.650
and suffered greatly inside.

18:37.670 --> 18:39.330
If you don't believe me,

18:40.260 --> 18:41.440
find an opportunity

18:41.460 --> 18:43.240
to look at his back.

18:46.910 --> 18:48.620
Then you'll understand.

18:49.460 --> 18:51.630
I can use all my divine power

18:51.660 --> 18:52.730
to suppress

18:52.760 --> 18:54.760
Zhao Yuanzhou's malicious energy,

18:54.790 --> 18:56.250
but it won't last for long.

18:56.250 --> 18:57.890
One month at most.

19:14.630 --> 19:16.310
Are you here to kill me?

19:21.380 --> 19:22.480
Go ahead.

19:25.080 --> 19:27.780
It's time to complete our deal.

19:34.630 --> 19:36.430
If you don't believe me,

19:36.950 --> 19:38.120
find an opportunity

19:38.150 --> 19:39.690
to look at his back.

19:41.930 --> 19:43.410
Then you'll understand.

19:52.960 --> 19:54.730
What are those scars?

19:57.580 --> 20:00.050
My self-inflicted punishment.

20:04.420 --> 20:06.250
With remorse in my heart,

20:07.580 --> 20:09.650
even being struck by lightning

20:12.630 --> 20:14.670
is not enough to appease

20:14.690 --> 20:16.450
the torment within.

20:19.990 --> 20:21.690
Eight scars.

20:22.710 --> 20:23.520
Eight years.

20:26.000 --> 20:26.790
Eight years.

20:29.640 --> 20:31.100
You had to do it to yourself

20:33.240 --> 20:35.140
every year after the blood moon?

20:38.730 --> 20:40.300
After every blood moon,

20:42.110 --> 20:45.690
I'd imprison myself in a small dwelling outside Tiandu.

20:48.020 --> 20:49.280
Not seeing anyone,

20:50.710 --> 20:52.570
not returning to the Wilderness,

20:53.350 --> 20:55.680
until I received a message from Ying Zhao.

20:58.240 --> 20:59.940
Only then did I come out.

21:06.710 --> 21:08.240
You're not going to kill me?

21:10.950 --> 21:13.010
You think I'm moved by you, don't you?

21:14.790 --> 21:15.890
Zhao Yuanzhou.

21:16.960 --> 21:19.170
Life is unfair to you.

21:20.720 --> 21:22.520
You did things you didn't mean to

21:23.210 --> 21:25.090
and have regrets about them.

21:26.790 --> 21:29.550
You think I'll forgive you just because

21:30.790 --> 21:32.230
you look pitiful?

21:33.810 --> 21:35.070
Is that what you think?

21:36.920 --> 21:37.930
No.

21:39.070 --> 21:40.310
I ended up like this

21:40.470 --> 21:42.870
because I did things I shouldn't have done.

21:44.610 --> 21:46.450
You should hate me.

21:46.480 --> 21:47.640
I do hate you.

21:50.730 --> 21:52.870
You think dying by my sword

21:54.410 --> 21:56.180
can wipe the slate clean?

22:00.240 --> 22:01.900
Can Ying Zhao, who died for you,

22:01.900 --> 22:03.140
come back to life?

22:06.980 --> 22:09.600
Can Ying Lei's tears not be shed?

22:13.620 --> 22:16.310
Can Wen Xiao hug her master again?

22:22.450 --> 22:23.560
Can my father

22:23.590 --> 22:24.430
and brother

22:26.110 --> 22:28.640
come back to me?

22:49.020 --> 22:49.780
No!

22:52.670 --> 22:53.570
No.

22:58.170 --> 22:59.260
No.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.290
No!

23:15.650 --> 23:16.410
No.

23:24.770 --> 23:26.910
If you want to die

23:27.610 --> 23:29.460
to settle all grudges

23:30.240 --> 23:32.170
and atone for your sins,

23:33.300 --> 23:35.560
then you don't deserve Wen Xiao's tears,

23:35.870 --> 23:37.870
you don't deserve Ying Lei's blood,

23:38.150 --> 23:42.010
and you certainly don't deserve Mountain God Ying Zhao dying for you.

23:44.310 --> 23:45.210
Zhao Yuanzhou,

23:47.190 --> 23:49.260
if you really feel remorse…

23:52.980 --> 23:54.710
you should do something that can truly

23:54.710 --> 23:56.150
make amends to everyone.

23:58.590 --> 24:00.150
When your debt is paid,

24:00.550 --> 24:01.780
I'll then come

24:02.350 --> 24:03.310
to kill you.

24:09.570 --> 24:11.770
But the Baize Token has been destroyed.

24:14.410 --> 24:16.320
I can't kill Li Lun.

24:19.150 --> 24:20.950
The Baize Token can be repaired.

24:22.790 --> 24:25.190
Ying Zhao had long prepared for sacrifice,

24:25.440 --> 24:28.170
so he told Ying Lei in advance

24:29.190 --> 24:31.250
the method to repair the Baize Token.

24:31.980 --> 24:33.180
Go to the Wilderness.

24:34.730 --> 24:36.490
Find Yao Water and Divine Wood.

24:37.670 --> 24:39.670
Then you can repair the Baize Token.

24:42.170 --> 24:43.190
Zhao Yuanzhou.

24:45.900 --> 24:47.650
Li Lun is your sworn enemy.

24:49.250 --> 24:50.470
His target

24:52.250 --> 24:54.250
has always been you.

24:57.840 --> 24:59.210
You must face him.

26:42.530 --> 26:47.760
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

26:47.810 --> 26:53.130
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

26:54.810 --> 27:00.060
♫There're no worries in its eyes♫

26:57.670 --> 26:58.830
Ying Lei.

26:59.300 --> 27:00.110
Ying Lei!

27:00.240 --> 27:05.490
♫It just wants to sleep on a roof♫

27:04.070 --> 27:05.160
Ying Lei.

27:06.400 --> 27:09.380
♫The bell jingles and sways♫

27:06.760 --> 27:08.220
Stop right there.

27:08.680 --> 27:10.560
Grandpa, save your breath.

27:09.500 --> 27:12.310
♫Thoughts circle back and forth♫

27:11.630 --> 27:12.750
I hate this place.

27:12.860 --> 27:18.050
♫Who can truly understand the essence of growing up?♫

27:12.890 --> 27:14.360
I hate the Wilderness.

27:14.600 --> 27:15.680
It's desolate and bleak.

27:15.680 --> 27:17.020
If I have to stay here forever,

27:17.020 --> 27:18.300
I'd rather die.

27:18.950 --> 27:21.970
♫Life is grand♫

27:21.840 --> 27:23.230
Silly boy.

27:22.610 --> 27:25.000
♫Yet so small♫

27:24.140 --> 27:25.670
Death is not scary.

27:25.500 --> 27:30.180
♫I hope everything is fine♫

27:26.070 --> 27:28.490
Death is not the end of everything.

27:28.780 --> 27:31.230
Don't talk about death so casually.

27:32.080 --> 27:33.600
Dying for a worthy cause

27:33.870 --> 27:35.430
with peace of mind

27:35.840 --> 27:37.230
is quite good.

27:37.770 --> 27:38.530
Grandpa,

27:38.640 --> 27:40.670
I don't want to feel dead inside.

27:40.830 --> 27:42.160
I like the mortal world.

27:42.320 --> 27:44.570
I like everything that's vibrant and lively.

27:44.570 --> 27:45.830
I like cooking smells and incense smoke.

27:45.830 --> 27:47.970
I like the trivial things of daily life.

27:47.970 --> 27:49.830
Compared to being a Mountain God,

27:50.000 --> 27:51.860
I prefer to be an ordinary person.

27:54.750 --> 27:56.260
I've dedicated my whole life

27:56.260 --> 28:01.500
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

27:56.510 --> 27:58.090
to Kunlun.

27:59.410 --> 28:01.120
But I don't regret it.

28:01.740 --> 28:07.090
♫It uses starlight as its feathers♫

28:01.880 --> 28:03.610
Being able to single-handedly

28:03.760 --> 28:05.550
nourish and protect all living beings

28:05.550 --> 28:07.810
is the honor of the Mountain God lineage.

28:08.560 --> 28:13.850
♫Snowflakes on the corners of its eyes♫

28:08.840 --> 28:10.320
But as your grandpa,

28:10.870 --> 28:12.860
I respect your decision.

28:13.380 --> 28:14.950
You can be a Mountain God

28:14.080 --> 28:19.310
♫It doesn't cry for years♫

28:15.530 --> 28:17.210
or an ordinary person.

28:20.180 --> 28:23.040
♫The river flows east and west♫

28:21.300 --> 28:24.150
For many demons in the Wilderness,

28:23.330 --> 28:26.150
♫The moonlight shines north and south♫

28:24.170 --> 28:26.570
their lifelong dream

28:26.680 --> 28:27.440
is just

28:26.760 --> 28:32.000
♫Lonely eyes can't make it through the dawn♫

28:27.730 --> 28:29.850
three simple words.

28:31.290 --> 28:32.510
What are they?

28:32.450 --> 28:35.580
♫Time is quiet♫

28:35.010 --> 28:36.290
Have a choice.

28:36.110 --> 28:39.060
♫And noisy at the same time♫

28:39.480 --> 28:43.860
♫How many are the fallen flowers?♫

28:41.180 --> 28:42.540
Boy,

28:43.110 --> 28:45.160
I failed to make you understand

28:44.870 --> 28:47.840
♫My heart is burning♫

28:45.830 --> 28:47.710
the glory and greatness

28:47.740 --> 28:48.870
of being a Mountain God.

28:48.060 --> 28:50.890
♫The snowflakes are falling♫

28:50.520 --> 28:52.280
I feel guilty about that.

28:51.500 --> 28:56.480
♫A heartbeat of cold and heat♫

28:57.330 --> 29:00.330
♫The world is beautiful♫

28:58.410 --> 28:59.690
Take care of yourself.

29:00.890 --> 29:03.400
♫But troubled♫

29:01.470 --> 29:02.590
When you have time,

29:03.240 --> 29:04.520
come back to Mount Kunlun

29:04.280 --> 29:08.670
♫It's going home♫

29:05.280 --> 29:06.440
to see me.

29:10.430 --> 29:14.770
♫I'm going home♫

29:13.910 --> 29:15.640
You've grown up.

29:18.480 --> 29:19.800
You choose your own way

29:19.090 --> 29:24.660
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

29:20.710 --> 29:22.300
into the future.

29:24.890 --> 29:30.710
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

29:27.510 --> 29:28.590
Grandpa.

29:33.060 --> 29:38.730
♫Its cry has never been heard♫

29:38.790 --> 29:45.400
♫Only I know its story♫

29:53.220 --> 29:54.040
Ying Lei.

29:58.730 --> 30:00.270
I'm not good at cooking,

30:01.820 --> 30:03.480
so I picked some plums for you.

30:05.160 --> 30:05.880
I just

30:05.980 --> 30:06.820
tried one.

30:06.890 --> 30:07.750
Very sweet.

30:34.340 --> 30:35.230
Thank you,

30:35.440 --> 30:36.360
Jiu.

30:37.890 --> 30:39.000
Young Mountain God,

30:39.000 --> 30:39.930
you're welcome.

31:41.390 --> 31:42.910
Jiu picked these plums.

31:44.750 --> 31:46.680
Mr. Zhuo, would you like to try one?

31:49.800 --> 31:51.800
Jiu picked them especially for you.

31:52.320 --> 31:53.230
You eat them.

31:58.780 --> 32:00.640
These plums were high on the tree.

32:04.110 --> 32:06.370
It must have been hard for him to get them.

32:12.270 --> 32:13.440
When I was little,

32:14.960 --> 32:16.600
if the plums were too high

32:17.970 --> 32:19.430
and I couldn't reach them,

32:20.140 --> 32:22.030
Grandpa would pick them for me.

32:26.600 --> 32:28.370
He's gone forever.

32:31.690 --> 32:32.650
Mr. Zhuo.

32:35.030 --> 32:36.740
Grandpa is gone.

32:43.760 --> 32:45.590
I no longer have a grandpa.

32:46.930 --> 32:49.070
I have no family left.

32:54.180 --> 32:55.980
When my father and brother died,

32:58.490 --> 33:00.560
I also lost all my family.

33:13.240 --> 33:14.240
Mr. Zhuo.

33:16.520 --> 33:17.700
Your heart

33:18.900 --> 33:20.770
must be covered with scars too.

33:29.110 --> 33:30.790
My brother once told me

33:32.680 --> 33:34.480
that the sufferings in the world

33:34.950 --> 33:36.950
always left people scarred.

33:38.820 --> 33:40.450
But if a part of you

33:40.480 --> 33:41.720
gets hurt

33:41.910 --> 33:43.510
and damaged again and again,

33:44.280 --> 33:46.030
it'll become hard and strong.

33:48.480 --> 33:50.060
At that time,

33:51.080 --> 33:52.530
I held my brother's hand,

33:52.560 --> 33:54.360
which he used to wield his sword,

33:55.100 --> 33:55.900
and said,

33:57.250 --> 33:58.530
"I know,

33:59.400 --> 34:00.800
that's called a callus."

34:02.570 --> 34:04.190
But my brother said

34:04.290 --> 34:05.670
what he was talking about

34:05.670 --> 34:06.810
wasn't a callus.

34:10.250 --> 34:11.830
What I'm talking about

34:12.130 --> 34:13.330
isn't a callus

34:14.960 --> 34:16.320
but the heart.

34:39.940 --> 34:41.530
What he was talking about

34:43.580 --> 34:44.600
wasn't a callus

34:45.520 --> 34:46.500
but the heart.

35:21.560 --> 35:23.410
You've been here all night?

35:26.610 --> 35:27.580
What's the matter,

35:27.580 --> 35:28.420
Sister Pei?

35:33.050 --> 35:35.140
I forgot to tell you this last night.

35:35.880 --> 35:37.000
Thank you.

35:43.590 --> 35:45.410
Look at the canyon before us.

35:46.800 --> 35:48.350
It's bottomless.

35:49.850 --> 35:51.840
If one fell off the cliff,

35:53.470 --> 35:55.530
even if they struggled desperately,

35:56.170 --> 35:58.000
they could only keep falling.

35:59.800 --> 36:01.030
At that moment,

36:03.230 --> 36:05.490
we'd wish for a tree,

36:06.790 --> 36:08.050
a rock,

36:09.600 --> 36:12.040
or even a cloud to catch us.

36:16.390 --> 36:18.360
You helped me uncover the real reason

36:18.360 --> 36:19.690
why Heng killed people.

36:21.910 --> 36:23.230
For me,

36:24.740 --> 36:28.320
it was like giving me a rock wall

36:28.560 --> 36:30.690
that I could lean on to catch my breath.

36:37.130 --> 36:38.040
And you

36:39.570 --> 36:41.290
are Zhao Yuanzhou's tree

36:41.320 --> 36:42.050
and cloud.

36:57.390 --> 36:58.790
Neither a tree nor a cloud

37:00.080 --> 37:01.940
can catch someone

37:02.520 --> 37:04.340
who's destined to fall.

37:05.720 --> 37:07.500
I can't forgive him,

37:10.300 --> 37:12.370
but I can't hate him either.

37:17.000 --> 37:19.130
So I can only hate myself.

37:24.860 --> 37:26.230
If one day

37:28.890 --> 37:29.950
you find out I have a secret

37:29.950 --> 37:31.840
as shocking as Zhao Yuanzhou's,

37:35.230 --> 37:36.630
would you hate me?

37:42.330 --> 37:43.610
That won't happen.

37:56.540 --> 37:57.870
Congratulations, Sir,

37:58.220 --> 38:00.820
for successfully destroying the Baize Token.

38:03.190 --> 38:04.170
The next step

38:04.720 --> 38:06.960
is to get Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core.

38:08.950 --> 38:11.750
He should've almost completed his mission by now.

38:13.080 --> 38:14.610
Then, Sir, your great cause

38:15.990 --> 38:17.190
will surely succeed.

38:37.630 --> 38:38.740
I'm so hungry.

38:39.680 --> 38:41.880
I wish I had saved more plums yesterday.

38:47.070 --> 38:47.870
Brother Zhuo.

38:48.130 --> 38:49.730
I brought you some food.

38:50.240 --> 38:51.290
Ying Lei said

38:51.620 --> 38:53.550
this is a delicacy from the Wilderness.

38:53.550 --> 38:54.610
It's called Zhuyu.

39:01.830 --> 39:02.970
Are you still angry?

39:04.360 --> 39:05.340
Yeah.

39:05.370 --> 39:07.900
Being suspected by someone you respect

39:08.020 --> 39:09.490
is indeed no small matter.

39:09.550 --> 39:11.340
You should be angry.

39:11.850 --> 39:12.980
Brother Zhuo,

39:13.320 --> 39:15.260
you think I respect you?

39:19.280 --> 39:20.410
Forget what I said.

39:20.430 --> 39:22.270
I admire you!

39:30.620 --> 39:31.660
Eat. Eat up.

39:33.640 --> 39:34.600
Ying Lei said

39:35.180 --> 39:38.040
Zhuyu is a divine herb that grows in the Western Sea.

39:38.040 --> 39:39.390
Eating just one blade of it

39:39.390 --> 39:41.320
can keep you full for an entire day.

40:02.510 --> 40:04.240
I brought you something to eat!

40:04.390 --> 40:05.970
I was worried Little Bunny might be hungry,

40:05.970 --> 40:07.620
so I roasted some taro.

40:07.710 --> 40:08.510
Try it.

40:12.420 --> 40:13.080
Didn't you…

40:14.270 --> 40:16.670
Didn't you tell us to eat Zhuyu?

40:20.080 --> 40:22.080
You just need to hold it in your hand.

40:22.160 --> 40:23.490
You don't need to eat it.

40:27.150 --> 40:28.180
It's alright.

40:28.440 --> 40:29.200
Brother Zhuo,

40:29.200 --> 40:30.520
I still admire you.

40:31.300 --> 40:32.310
Shut up.

40:33.070 --> 40:33.870
Okay.

41:12.510 --> 41:13.510
Lady Goddess.

41:16.830 --> 41:18.900
Looks like you've made your choice.

41:19.110 --> 41:19.590
Well,

41:19.630 --> 41:20.720
Young Mountain God,

41:20.720 --> 41:23.200
you didn't look like much usually,

41:23.220 --> 41:25.210
but you look quite presentable today in that outfit,

41:25.210 --> 41:26.980
giving off a bit of the vibe of the Mountain God.

41:26.980 --> 41:28.020
Do I?

41:29.240 --> 41:31.840
This is the first time you've complimented me.

41:34.150 --> 41:35.400
I've made my decision.

41:35.400 --> 41:36.260
I'll stay here,

41:36.390 --> 41:37.550
protecting Kunlun,

41:38.060 --> 41:40.460
continuing my grandpa's unfinished work.

41:40.760 --> 41:43.090
With my limited power as the Mountain God,

41:43.560 --> 41:45.620
I'll try to delay Kunlun's collapse.

41:49.040 --> 41:50.570
You're staying here?

41:56.540 --> 41:57.310
Yes.

42:00.820 --> 42:03.080
I'm not going to the Wilderness with you.

42:06.810 --> 42:07.960
Take care, guys.

42:10.050 --> 42:11.590
We'll meet again.

42:14.740 --> 42:16.940
I'll do my best to be a good Mountain God…

42:20.010 --> 42:21.510
to make my grandpa proud.

42:22.950 --> 42:24.070
Your grandpa

42:25.300 --> 42:27.310
was always proud of you.

42:30.080 --> 42:30.880
Ying Lei.

42:32.130 --> 42:33.320
Take care.

42:36.990 --> 42:38.000
Okay.

42:48.090 --> 42:49.150
This…

42:56.100 --> 42:56.980
It's for you.

43:00.360 --> 43:01.820
The journey ahead is long.

43:02.160 --> 43:03.080
I hope

43:03.110 --> 43:04.180
it'll be of help.

43:08.000 --> 43:08.590
Yeah.

43:10.310 --> 43:12.710
We'll inevitably have to run for our lives.

43:16.670 --> 43:17.470
Take care.

43:18.040 --> 43:19.190
Next time we come back,

43:19.190 --> 43:21.650
make the most delicious dishes for me, okay?

43:23.480 --> 43:24.890
I'm not used to it.

43:26.600 --> 43:27.540
Indeed.

43:28.320 --> 43:29.690
This outfit

43:30.410 --> 43:32.210
is new to me too.

43:33.820 --> 43:34.820
Maybe

43:34.850 --> 43:36.480
I should grow my beard back.

43:37.010 --> 43:40.080
Otherwise, it really feels like a child is wearing adults' clothes.

43:40.080 --> 43:41.320
I mean,

43:41.640 --> 43:43.300
you'll not be around anymore,

43:43.870 --> 43:45.310
and I'm not used to that.

43:47.670 --> 43:49.400
Even though you're quite noisy

43:49.650 --> 43:51.050
and annoying sometimes.

43:51.920 --> 43:52.410
Ah,

43:52.440 --> 43:53.180
never mind.

43:54.030 --> 43:55.000
At least

43:55.840 --> 43:57.840
when Brother Zhuo wasn't around

43:58.430 --> 43:59.600
and I was scared,

44:00.400 --> 44:01.660
I could hold your arm,

44:02.670 --> 44:03.650
grab your hand,

44:05.150 --> 44:06.410
and seize your sleeve.

44:08.760 --> 44:10.810
Then I'll cut off a piece of my sleeve for you.

44:10.810 --> 44:12.250
When you're afraid,

44:12.720 --> 44:13.850
you can hold it tight

44:14.110 --> 44:15.990
as if I were by your side.

44:16.430 --> 44:17.670
I don't need that.

44:18.190 --> 44:21.540
In the mortal world, cutting off the sleeve means cutting ties.

44:21.540 --> 44:23.600
I don't want to be an ingrate.

44:26.000 --> 44:26.750
Jiu.

44:28.630 --> 44:29.950
You'll surely become

44:30.600 --> 44:32.400
the best physician in the world.

44:33.830 --> 44:34.630
Good luck.

44:35.330 --> 44:36.530
I'll miss you.

44:59.310 --> 45:00.040
We will.

45:06.290 --> 45:07.910
We'll meet again.

45:08.740 --> 45:09.580
Yeah.
